  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/p9lNs6l.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"578\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>預設深色模式</strong></h1>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><br>Minecraft：Java 版的深色模式資源包</h2>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcreativecommons.org%252flicenses%252fby-nc-sa%252f4.0%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/License-CC BY--NC--SA 4.0-brightgreen.svg\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/nebuIr/Default-Dark-Mode/releases/latest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/xnebulr/Minecraft-Default-Dark-Mode?label=Release&&cacheSeconds=3600\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/nebuIr/Default-Dark-Mode/releases\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/xnebulr/Minecraft-Default-Dark-Mode/total?label=Downloads&logo=github&cacheSeconds=3600\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fdefault-dark-mode%252fversions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/6SLU7tS5?logo=modrinth&logoColor=fff\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/default-dark-mode/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/349116?logo=curseforge&logoColor=fff\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdarkomizer.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.darkomizer.com/shields/downloads/darkomizer\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/349116.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"557\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">此資源包為 Minecraft 介面提供簡易的深色模式／暗色主題。僅使用修改過的原版貼圖。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdarkomizer.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/R0tc2H8.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"578\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>模組支援</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>需要特定模組的支援嗎？請在 <a href=\"https://github.com/nebuIr/Default-Dark-Mode/issues/new/choose\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上建立問題並提交模組支援請求。<br>提交模組支援請求前，請確認您的模組尚未在其他問題中提出過請求。</p>\n<p>所有已支援模組的清單可於 <a href=\"https://github.com/nebuIr/Default-Dark-Mode/wiki/Mod-support\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub Wiki</a> 查看。</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><br>截圖</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2GKuNUE.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VFzY5qe.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7UPrk5X.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3gA1GHt.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/itTFT9w.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yhpuzBc.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xkHTdLG.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p>",
